<% case @outcome %>
<% when "canceled" %>
A client canceled their plan. It ends <%= @organization.cancel_at&.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") || "at the end of the billing period" %>.

Reason:  <%= Organization::CANCELLATION_REASONS[@organization.cancellation_reason] || "-" %>
Comment: <%= @organization.cancellation_comment || "-" %>
<% when "kept_with_discount" %>
A client started to cancel, then stayed after taking the retention offer (<%= Plan::RETENTION_OFFER %>).
<% when "resumed" %>
A client who had canceled changed their mind; their plan will keep renewing.
<% end %>

Organization: <%= @organization.name %>
Owner:        <%= @organization.owner&.email || "-" %>
Plan:         <%= @organization.plan_definition&.name || @organization.plan || "-" %>

<% if @outcome == "canceled" %>A personal call before the end date sometimes saves these.
<% end %><%= reports_index_url %>
